**Correctif :** (1) Add validator isValidCommitSha(s): /^[0-9a-f]{7,}$/ (min 7 hex chars). (2) buildJsDelivrUrl returns null if commit invalid. (3) universalCapture.js validates commitShard response before manifest write. (4) Runtime assertion in ImageNodeViewer: if buildJsDelivrUrl returns null, log reason.

