**Correctif :** (1) Add schema validation in readMediaManifest: assert m.type === 'chunked-media', m.vis === 'public', m.count >= 0, Array.isArray(m.ivs), m.ivs.length === m.count, etc. (2) In downloadChunkedMedia, check before loop: if (!m || m.type !== 'chunked-media' || !m.ivs || m.ivs.length !== m.count) throw new Error('manifest corrupted'). (3) Wrap the entire buffer collection in try/catch and surface a clear error: 'Cannot download: manifest is corrupted or partially written. Please retry.' (4) Add a /api/validate-manifest endpoint to pre-check manifests before download.

